    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hotlines dont really do anything when the whole world is against u. like, what's the point of talking to a stranger when i've literally lost my entire life? i thought being a good person mattered, but it just made everything fall apart. everything is just empty now. it feels like there's no way to actually fix this, no matter how much i talk to someone.",
