      "role": "user",
      "content": "survive the next hour... but what am i even surviving for? to just sit in an empty apartment and wait for the next thing to go wrong? i keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i just wasn't here to deal with the fallout. it feels like the world has already moved on without me, like i'm just a ghost. everything i worked for is gone. i'm just so tired of fighting a losing battle.",
